{{! allcrud-generator: brand-new template, NOT an override of an embedded openapi-generator
    file (and NOT related to the stock "converter.mustache" that ships with the spring
    generator, which is Spring's enum string-conversion beans - unrelated concept, same
    filename only by coincidence; this one replaces it because it's registered under the
    same name via CodegenConfig#apiTemplateFiles() in the generation driver code, see
    ProductExampleGeneration, with output suffix "Converter.java").

    Generates a skeleton implementing com.techmath.allcrud.converter.Converter, with both
    methods throwing UnsupportedOperationException. This is a new pattern established by
    this generator, not based on any existing core precedent - it exists so the generated
    Controller/Service have something to compile and wire against out of the box, while
    making it obvious and loud that the actual entity<->VO mapping still needs to be
    written by hand.

    allcrudEntityName / allcrudPojoClassName / allcrudIdType are resolved by
    AllcrudSpringCodegen - see that class.
    Generated class name is prefixed with allcrudEntityName ("Product"), not the stock
    per-tag classname variable ("ProductsApi", plural, "Api"-suffixed) - that mismatch was
    a naming bug fixed after the fact, not an intentional customization. }}
